The initial medium order (18) was still vulnerable to row-preserving min-conflicts, so I raised the retained regimes to orders 22 and 26. Across the first checks, both now exhaust their 100k/150k public MRV budgets and all three attacks fail; planted witnesses still verify. I’m running the full 200,000-sample and 20-seed canonical-invariance suite next.
