The README explicitly notes that the [source paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.09362) supplies the \(S\)-packing definition, while hardness for the encoded completion problem relies on [Colbourn’s partial Latin-square NP-completeness result](https://doi.org/10.1016/0166-218X(84)90075-1).
